# Copy to apps/api/.env (gitignored). Never paste real values into chat, commits or logs.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@host/db?sslmode=require
SESSION_PEPPER=change-me-32-random-bytes-base64url
# Email sign-in codes (2026-09-27): the owner's Gmail + a 16-letter app password
# (myaccount.google.com/apppasswords; needs 2-Step Verification). Unset → /v1/auth/code is 503.
GMAIL_USER=you@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=abcdefghijklmnop
#
# Deploying: Vercel only creates the api/index function when apps/api/api/index.js EXISTS
# in the upload (it is gitignored build output; `npm run build` overwrites it on Vercel).
# From a clean checkout, create a placeholder first, or every route answers 500
# (found 2026-09-27: the deploy ran Vercel's own src/app.ts entry instead).
